# ── civ-bench ignores ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Raw game-run input data + canonical CSVs, and generated reports/figures/
# trained estimators (see AGENTS.md "Repo layout"). Nothing experiment-specific
# beyond configs/ examples lives in git.
runs/
/reports/
reports-*/

# Concrete benchmark run-specs are LOCAL and gitignored — they point at real
# data roots (e.g. J:/) or machine-specific paths. Only the *.template.json
# examples (and the catalogs + benchmark.md schema) are tracked. Copy a template
# to a local configs/benchmark*.json to actually run.
configs/benchmark*.json
!configs/benchmark*.template.json

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Optuna study DBs / local scratch
*.db
